# Never send local secrets into the build context - .env.local holds real
# dev credentials (Mongo, OAuth, Stripe test keys) and has no business
# being anywhere near a Docker build. It also has higher precedence than
# .env.production in Next's env-loading order, so if it were present here
# it would silently shadow apps/web/.env.production's NEXT_PUBLIC_ values
# during the build - which is exactly what happened in local testing before
# this was added. .env.production itself is deliberately NOT excluded here.
.env.local
**/.env.local
.env*.local
